][reg=set]

pattern_consideration: #[
  "Home page: literal first-viewport orientation.",
  "Website field guide: reference document and publishing-surface anatomy.",
  "Site design: diagrammatic anatomy and reusable web tropes.",
  "Recipes: restaurant ownership and garden maintenance as service/season anchors.",
  "Publisher layer: audience, disclosure, trope timing, inline tone, and spatial affordance metadata.",
  "Portability: future parallel publishing forks can specialize genre and audience without changing base runtime contracts."
][reg=set]

